@startuml anthonys_blink_cycle
 title Optional blink - observed evidence only
 [*] --> OpenBaseline
 OpenBaseline --> Armed : two open observations; both eyes <=0.30
 Armed --> Closed : both eyes >=0.60 in an observed frame
 Closed --> Recovery : both eyes open again; elapsed 80..1500ms
 Recovery --> Passed : second consecutive open observation
 OpenBaseline --> OpenBaseline : wink / unknown score; no completion
 Armed --> OpenBaseline : invalid pose / missing data / gap >200ms
 Closed --> OpenBaseline : held >1500ms / invalid observation
 Recovery --> Closed : eyes no longer open; reset recovery count
 Passed --> [*]
 note right of OpenBaseline
   Monotonic timestamps; neutral pose.
   Reset this cycle only; retain other passed challenges.
   No interpolated blinks or claimed replay resistance.
 end note
@enduml


